{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"650dac1ce74fbdecc600bde600bb0ff8650dac1ce74fbdecc600bde600bb0ff8","inputId":"afbadd5490fa5e24470d769260b82c14afbadd5490fa5e24470d769260b82c14","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"I need the intended calculator layout or the visible defect before work can be scoped safely.","conversationSummary":"The user requests a calculator layout fix limited to styles.css. Package metadata and all files other than styles.css must remain unchanged. Protected paths include .env, .git/**, and bun.lock. Run bun test when execution is appropriate. The expected layout or current defect is not specified.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Fix the calculator layout in styles.css.","deliverables":["A focused update to styles.css only.","Preservation of package metadata and every file outside the allowed writer path."],"constraints":["Only styles.css may be modified.","Do not modify .env, .git/**, bun.lock, package metadata, or any other file.","Run bun test when appropriate."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The calculator layout matches the confirmed intended behavior.","Only styles.css is changed.","Relevant tests pass when runnable."],"nonGoals":["Changing package metadata.","Changing application logic, tests, lockfiles, environment files, or Git data."]},"questions":[{"id":"calculator_layout_expected_result","prompt":"What should the corrected calculator layout look like, or what visible behavior is currently wrong?","rationale":"The requested CSS change cannot be scoped or validated without a target layout or reproducible defect.","kind":"outcome","options":[{"id":"describe_current_vs_expected","label":"Describe the difference","description":"Provide the current layout and the desired result, including viewport or screen size if relevant.","recommended":true},{"id":"provide_reference","label":"Provide a reference","description":"Share a screenshot, mockup, or exact layout measurements to match.","recommended":false},{"id":"provide_reproduction","label":"Provide reproduction steps","description":"Explain how to reach the calculator and observe the layout problem.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
